#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/doc/webgpu-pbr-dev.md:1
msgid "WebGPU physically based rendering - Developer guide"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/doc/webgpu-pbr-dev.md:3
msgid ""
"This document describes how `vtkWebGPUPolyDataMapper` shades actors whose "
"property uses `SetInterpolationToPBR()`: where the material and environment "
"data live on the GPU, how the fragment shader is assembled, and the tools "
"available to debug it. The shading model is the one of the OpenGL backend, "
"so that both backends render a scene the same way and share test baselines."
msgstr ""

